Contents
--------
wasm/
    The MediaPipe Tasks-Vision WebAssembly runtime, copied verbatim from
    the `@mediapipe/tasks-vision` npm package (Apache-2.0):
      vision_wasm_internal.js / .wasm          (SIMD build)
      vision_wasm_nosimd_internal.js / .wasm   (no-SIMD fallback)

models/
    Pre-trained landmarker model bundles, downloaded unmodified from
    Google's model storage (https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/),
    Apache-2.0:
      hand_landmarker.task        (Hand Landmarker)
      face_landmarker.task        (Face Landmarker)
      pose_landmarker_lite.task   (Pose Landmarker, lite)

No changes have been made to these files. They are provided on an "AS IS"
basis, without warranties or conditions of any kind. See LICENSE for the
full terms.
